// A literal pattern leaf over a UNION-typed tuple slot: the kernel's
// typed element read is total (a slot whose value isn't of the
// pattern's prim family reads as the placeholder 0), so the checked
// op's ArithError value in slot 2 compared EQUAL to the `u8:0`
// literal and the jit took the arm the interp refused (aug06f
// divergence_000000, ryouko). Fixed by requiring the leaf's STATIC
// type to freeze to the literal's prim family — union leaves de-fuse
// like Bind leaves. interp/jit must both fall to `_` => false.
select (2, u8:0 -? u8:1) { (2, u8:0) => true, _ => false }
